description=Drop any .mid file in your Zomboid/midi folder and play it live through Project Zomboid. Form bands of up to 16 players, each claiming one MIDI channel so every instrument comes from a different musician, with distance-based volume falloff around the band leader. Real-time synthesis via Java's built-in Gervill synth + a user-swappable SoundFont. Requires ZombieBuddy.
